# Out of scope

This Cursor rule supplements the repository AGENTS.md instructions. It may add scoped requirements but may not weaken root security invariants.

**Authority:** root [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) §6 · [`docs/ROADMAP.md`](../../docs/ROADMAP.md)

## Do not invent without explicit approval

- Browser extension (`apps/extension`)
- WalletConnect / EIP-1193 provider injection
- Hardware wallet support
- SPL token sends
- NFT gallery
- New state-management library (use Zustand)
- Backend/server
- Crypto-lib replacements (`@scure/*`, `@noble/*`, hash-wasm)

## Also do not

- Ban or remove already-shipped features
- Assume ROADMAP checkboxes without reading [`docs/ROADMAP.md`](../../docs/ROADMAP.md)

Stop and ask instead of generating the above.
